==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*6 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 16 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

